    "detailed_description": "<i>Contains some content that may offend some players....... fantasy violence,killing<br>nudity,revealing outfits,sexual innuendo,crude language.</i><br><br><br><br><strong>Why Play 1 Game When You Can Play 32?</strong><br><br>Try you skills in a variety of game genres . This 32 in 1 collection will test your abilities in puzzle games, FPSs, shooters ,beat em ups and many more!<br><br><strong>Short But Sweet..<i>sometimes</i>....</strong><br><br>Most on the collection are more akin to arcade style play length for quick sessions, while others provide a lengthier challenge for those looking.<br><br><strong>Scores,Speed Runs, Survival</strong><br><br>Can you get the best possible score? How fast can you beat a game? Can you make it without losing too many lives? A little something for everyone.<br><br><strong>Bla Bla Bla Anything Else?..</strong><br><br>A salute to those cheap shareware and multi cart cartridges sold years ago that some of us have a bit of a soft spot. With nods <br>to the styles and quality of both,  a bit of unusual humor and a few references you just might get, its possible you may enjoy yourself... or mabe you wont..I dunno...whatever..",
    "about_the_game": "<i>Contains some content that may offend some players....... fantasy violence,killing<br>nudity,revealing outfits,sexual innuendo,crude language.</i><br><br><br><br><strong>Why Play 1 Game When You Can Play 32?</strong><br><br>Try you skills in a variety of game genres . This 32 in 1 collection will test your abilities in puzzle games, FPSs, shooters ,beat em ups and many more!<br><br><strong>Short But Sweet..<i>sometimes</i>....</strong><br><br>Most on the collection are more akin to arcade style play length for quick sessions, while others provide a lengthier challenge for those looking.<br><br><strong>Scores,Speed Runs, Survival</strong><br><br>Can you get the best possible score? How fast can you beat a game? Can you make it without losing too many lives? A little something for everyone.<br><br><strong>Bla Bla Bla Anything Else?..</strong><br><br>A salute to those cheap shareware and multi cart cartridges sold years ago that some of us have a bit of a soft spot. With nods <br>to the styles and quality of both,  a bit of unusual humor and a few references you just might get, its possible you may enjoy yourself... or mabe you wont..I dunno...whatever..",
    "short_description": "A tribute to those less then stellar computer shareware and multicart games of the past, 32 in 1 features many different game genres, some with a odd sense of humor. Games mainly lean on point scores ,speed runs and survival, all to give you the player a sense of pride and accomplishment!",
